70		 * matching (a policy row may target one agent or automation). Agent → agent id;
71		 * automation → `automation:<id>`; system/automation token (no agent id) → null.
72		 * Null means "any principal of this kind". Plumbed here now; consumed by the
73		 * per-principal resolver in a later commit.
74		 */
