 * illegal. And `entity-management.ts` builds the approval deferral AFTER the
 * transaction returns, so the throw means no card is queued either. The work is
 * denied, misattributed to the rule, and dropped.
 *
 * This must be fixed BEFORE write rules are armed for tenants: arming them turns
 * a latent ordering bug into a routine way to lose an agent's work. The control
 * test proves the hold is the cause — the identical agent write succeeds when no
 * human owns `status`.
 */''',
'''/**
